# rpg/art/doll/clips/actions/sword.clip: A3's sword swing (the slice; ACTIONS owns the families in P2c). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# The side keys stand on `legs=stance` (A3's contact legs, kept pixel for pixel: the walk's own contact drawings were
# redrawn sturdier for the owner, 2026-10-19).

body man
clip windup R family sword variant 0
f armL=- armR=sw_r0 held=a3r0 hilt=- legs=stance neck=rest sheath=rest torso=rest tuft=- bob=1 lean=-1 ms=70
clip strike R family sword variant 0
f armL=- armR=sw_r1 expr=fierce fx=a1 held=a3r1 hilt=- legs=lunge neck=rest sheath=rest torso=rest tuft=- bob=1 lean=1 ms=110
clip follow R family sword variant 0
f armL=- armR=sw_r2 expr=fierce fx=a2 held=a3r2 hilt=- legs=lunge neck=rest sheath=rest torso=rest tuft=- bob=2 lean=1 ms=70
f armL=- armR=sw_r3 held=a3r3 hilt=- legs=stance neck=rest sheath=rest torso=rest tuft=- ms=60
clip windup D family sword variant 0
